Reset
git reset --soft commitish - Get back to a previous commit but retain the changes.
Committed changes will be put in the staging area, uncommitted remain staged or unstaged as before.

git reset --hard commitish - Get back to a previous commit and remove uncommited, commited changes(up until that point.


